    'Scénario fictif documenté · {n} tickets/jour · panier {p} € TTC · {m} mois · camion acheté et amorti, emplacements et renfort inclus.': ['Documented fictional scenario · {n} receipts/day · average ticket €{p} incl. VAT · {m} months · truck bought and depreciated, pitches and extra staff included.', '', '', '', '', ''],
    'Scénario fictif documenté · {n} tickets/jour · panier {p} € TTC · camion acheté et amorti, emplacements et renfort inclus.': ['Documented fictional scenario · {n} receipts/day · average ticket €{p} incl. VAT · truck bought and depreciated, pitches and extra staff included.', '', '', '', '', ''],
    '55 tickets/jour, 14 € TTC, 5 jours/semaine, 11 mois : hypothèses, pas moyennes nationales. Camion acheté 49 000 € HT amorti sur 7 ans (7 000 €/an), pas de loyer de camion ajouté. Dirigeant assimilé salarié + renfort à temps partiel ; cotisations indicatives. Emplacements 200 €/mois, laboratoire/garage 350 €, énergie et déplacements 500 €, assurance 200 €, entretien 220 €. Capital des emprunts exclu des charges.': ['55 receipts/day, €14 incl. VAT, 5 days/week, 11 months: assumptions, not national averages. Truck bought for €49,000 excl. VAT, depreciated over 7 years (€7,000/year), no truck rent added. Owner treated as an employee + part-time extra staff; indicative contributions. Pitches €200/month, kitchen/garage €350, energy and travel €500, insurance €200, maintenance €220. Loan principal excluded from costs.', '', '', '', '', ''],
    '{n} tickets/jour, panier {p} € TTC, {j} jours/semaine, {m} mois (tickets et panier lus dans sa caisse) : hypothèses, pas moyennes nationales. Camion acheté 49 000 € HT amorti sur 7 ans (7 000 €/an), pas de loyer de camion ajouté. Dirigeant assimilé salarié + renfort à temps partiel ; cotisations indicatives. Emplacements 200 €/mois, laboratoire/garage 350 €, énergie et déplacements 500 €, assurance 200 €, entretien 220 €. Capital des emprunts exclu des charges.': ['{n} receipts/day, average ticket €{p} incl. VAT, {j} days/week, {m} months (receipts and average ticket read from its till): assumptions, not national averages. Truck bought for €49,000 excl. VAT, depreciated over 7 years (€7,000/year), no truck rent added. Owner treated as an employee + part-time extra staff; indicative contributions. Pitches €200/month, kitchen/garage €350, energy and travel €500, insurance €200, maintenance €220. Loan principal excluded from costs.', '', '', '', '', ''],
