    '{n} tickets/jour, panier {p} € TTC (tickets et panier lus dans sa caisse) : hypothèses, pas moyennes nationales. Camion acheté 49 000 € HT amorti sur 7 ans (7 000 €/an), pas de loyer de camion ajouté. Dirigeant assimilé salarié + renfort à temps partiel ; cotisations indicatives. Emplacements 200 €/mois, laboratoire/garage 350 €, énergie et déplacements 500 €, assurance 200 €, entretien 220 €. Capital des emprunts exclu des charges.': ['{n} receipts/day, average ticket €{p} incl. VAT (receipts and average ticket read from its till): assumptions, not national averages. Truck bought for €49,000 excl. VAT, depreciated over 7 years (€7,000/year), no truck rent added. Owner treated as an employee + part-time extra staff; indicative contributions. Pitches €200/month, kitchen/garage €350, energy and travel €500, insurance €200, maintenance €220. Loan principal excluded from costs.', '', '', '', '', ''],
